    "footer:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(5)>small:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "© 2026 KDH Advocates LLP. All rights reserved.",
    "footer:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(5)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Trust. Integrity. Results.",
    "#profile-yvonne-kinya-kiruja-1>button:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "×",
    "#profile-yvonne-kinya-kiruja-1>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Managing Partner",
    "#yvonne-kinya-kiruja-1-name::text-0": "Yvonne Kinya Kiruja",
    "#profile-yvonne-kinya-kiruja-1>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>span:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "LLB (Kenyatta University)",
    "#profile-yvonne-kinya-kiruja-1>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>span:nth-of-type(1)::text-1": "PGDip (Kenya School of Law)",
    "#profile-yvonne-kinya-kiruja-1>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Yvonne is the Managing Partner at KDH Advocates and Head of the firm's Commercial and Real Estate Practice. She has extensive experience advising local and international clients on complex real estate, construction, and finance matters. Her work includes structuring development projects, arranging real estate finance, implementing securitisation frameworks, and guiding high-net-worth individuals through estate planning strategies.",
    "#profile-yvonne-kinya-kiruja-1>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(2)::text-0": "Her experience at Ecobank gave her a strong foundation in securitisation and banking regulatory compliance. She works closely with financial institutions and SACCOs on compliant frameworks for securitisation, recovery, and governance, while also advising on structured finance, syndicated lending, project finance, asset financing, enforcement of securities, and capital raising.",
    "#profile-yvonne-kinya-kiruja-1>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(3)::text-0": "Her real estate practice spans acquisitions, sales and conveyancing, property development and joint ventures, commercial and residential leases, land use planning, zoning, environmental compliance, construction contract management, and property disputes.",
    "#profile-yvonne-kinya-kiruja-1>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(4)::text-0": "Yvonne combines transactional, advisory, and dispute-resolution expertise to serve property developers, financial institutions, and investment companies as a trusted adviser in Kenya's real estate and construction landscape.",
    "#profile-brance-ken-odhiambo-2>button:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "×",
    "#profile-brance-ken-odhiambo-2>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Partner",
    "#brance-ken-odhiambo-2-name::text-0": "Brance Ken Odhiambo",
    "#profile-brance-ken-odhiambo-2>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>span:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "LLB (Kenyatta University)",
    "#profile-brance-ken-odhiambo-2>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>span:nth-of-type(1)::text-1": "PGDip (Kenya School of Law)",
    "#profile-brance-ken-odhiambo-2>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Brance is a Founding Partner at KDH Advocates and a registered Patent Agent. He leads the firm's Dispute Resolution Department, representing national and international clients in complex, high-stakes commercial, construction, insolvency, and intellectual property matters.",
    "#profile-brance-ken-odhiambo-2>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(2)::text-0": "He has acted in substantial arbitrations concerning electrical equipment and advertising boards, a major Nairobi construction project, and the development of a bespoke management system. He has also defended a microfinance institution against a multimillion-shilling employment claim.",
    "#profile-brance-ken-odhiambo-2>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(3)::text-0": "His practice extends to intellectual property and real estate. Brance has advised in a significant hospitality trademark dispute, defended homeowners against fraudulent land claims, and guided clients through high-value property acquisitions in Nairobi.",
    "#profile-brance-ken-odhiambo-2>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(4)::text-0": "He represents the Law Society of Kenya, Nairobi Branch, on the Supreme Court Bar-Bench Committee, Tax Liaison Committee, and Commercial Court Bar-Bench Committee. He also serves on the boards of Shield Forensics Kenya and International Christian Youthworks (ICY), Africa.",
    "#profile-imanuel-fwamba-barasa-3>button:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "×",
    "#profile-imanuel-fwamba-barasa-3>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Partner",
    "#imanuel-fwamba-barasa-3-name::text-0": "Imanuel Fwamba Barasa",
    "#profile-imanuel-fwamba-barasa-3>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>span:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "LLB & PGDip",
    "#profile-imanuel-fwamba-barasa-3>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>span:nth-of-type(1)::text-1": "LLM, International Economic Law & Policy",
    "#profile-imanuel-fwamba-barasa-3>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Imanuel leads the International Law and Trade Practice at KDH Advocates. He advises on cross-border transactions, international trade, and investment agreements, drawing on experience with EU export controls and sanctions in Brussels and trade-policy work supporting Kenya's Ministry of Industry, Trade, and Investments.",
    "#profile-imanuel-fwamba-barasa-3>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(2)::text-0": "His international-organisation experience includes the Green Climate Fund, where he worked on grant, loan, and equity investment agreements for climate projects, and legal work with the UN's International Fund for Agricultural Development and World Food Programme in Rome.",
    "#profile-imanuel-fwamba-barasa-3>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(3)::text-0": "Imanuel has advised across employment, mining, investment establishment, banking acquisitions, and supply-chain finance. His work includes due diligence on tax, intellectual property, shareholding, and regulatory compliance, as well as drafting and negotiating key transaction documents.",
    "#profile-imanuel-fwamba-barasa-3>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(4)::text-0": "He serves as adjunct faculty at Kenyatta University School of Law, coordinates the TradeLab, and contributes to scholarship on the African Continental Free Trade Area and the East African Community Rule of Law Index. He is also Chairperson of the Kenyatta University School of Law Alumni Association.",
    "#profile-lynne-jeruto-4>button:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "×",
    "#profile-lynne-jeruto-4>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Associate",
    "#lynne-jeruto-4-name::text-0": "Lynne Jeruto",
    "#profile-lynne-jeruto-4>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>span:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Bachelor of Laws",
    "#profile-lynne-jeruto-4>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>span:nth-of-type(1)::text-1": "Postgraduate Diploma in Law",
    "#profile-lynne-jeruto-4>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Lynne is an Associate in the Dispute Resolution Department. She works closely with the partners in complex litigation and arbitration before domestic and international courts and tribunals.",
    "#profile-lynne-jeruto-4>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(2)::text-0": "Her matters include commercial litigation and arbitration, corporate and shareholder disputes, employment and labour relations, constitutional and administrative law, land, and insolvency.",
    "#profile-lynne-jeruto-4>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(3)::text-0": "She brings a keen eye for detail and a strategic approach, combining efficient litigation with alternative mechanisms such as arbitration and mediation to secure the best outcomes for clients.",
    "#profile-dorcas-adhiambo-5>button:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "×",
    "#profile-dorcas-adhiambo-5>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Associate",
    "#dorcas-adhiambo-5-name::text-0": "Dorcas Adhiambo",
    "#profile-dorcas-adhiambo-5>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>span:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Bachelor of Laws",
    "#profile-dorcas-adhiambo-5>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>span:nth-of-type(1)::text-1": "Postgraduate Diploma in Law",
    "#profile-dorcas-adhiambo-5>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Dorcas is an Associate in the Real Estate and Construction Practice. She supports property developers, financial institutions, and local and international investors through complex transactions and developments.",
    "#profile-dorcas-adhiambo-5>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(2)::text-0": "Her work spans acquisitions, sales and conveyancing, property development and joint ventures, commercial and residential leasing, land use planning, environmental compliance, real estate finance, securitisation, and construction contract management.",
    "#profile-dorcas-adhiambo-5>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(3)::text-0": "Dorcas approaches every matter with precision and a client-focused perspective, structuring transactions to minimise risk while maximising value.",
    "#profile-scort-sala-6>button:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "×",
    "#profile-scort-sala-6>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Associate",
    "#scort-sala-6-name::text-0": "Scort Sala",
    "#profile-scort-sala-6>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>span:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Advocate of the High Court of Kenya",
    "#profile-scort-sala-6>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Scort advises employers and employees on employment contracts, workplace policies, compensation structures, and the full range of workplace issues.",
    "#profile-scort-sala-6>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(2)::text-0": "His practice includes dispute resolution and litigation, health and safety compliance, redundancies, terminations, restructuring, collective bargaining, industrial relations, and Kenyan employment-law compliance.",
    "#profile-scort-sala-6>div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(2)>p:nth-of-type(3)::text-0": "He focuses on practical, balanced solutions to workplace challenges.",
    "div:nth-of-type(1)>p:nth-of-type(1)>b:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Your privacy matters.",
    "div:nth-of-type(1)>p:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": " This site uses essential storage only to remember your cookie choice.",
    "div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>button:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Essential only",
    "div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>button:nth-of-type(2)::text-0": "Accept all",
    "div:nth-of-type(1)>div:nth-of-type(1)>a:nth-of-type(1)::text-0": "Learn more"
  },
